{"agent":"Monster3-CFG-defaults-shared-7267fe","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The new test only reads `.ddflow/config.toml` and checks that two strings appear in `lease.shared_globs`; it does not exercise the stated acceptance condition that two knob tasks can claim and merge concurrently, nor the stated falsifier that a knob task still gets a lease refusal on the defaults path. For example, if `lease.claim` still refuses a task that touches `ddflow/templates/default.toml` because the path is no longer in `WIRING['knob']` and `shared_globs` is only consulted for already-declared task globs, two knob tasks in different sections will still block, but this test will pass because the config file contains the expected strings. Thus the change has no regression test for the 15-hour `default.toml` block it claims to close.","digest":"9ecd0a17cb5705aa","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_task_add_wiring_globs.py:test_the_generated_defaults_are_shared_lease_globs_not_a_per_task_lease","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_task_add_wiring_globs.py:test_the_generated_defaults_are_shared_lease_globs_not_a_per_task_lease"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":4074,"diff_sha":"05890e50c35e202e1152c5690330509e43be4016f89455cd8035976c6b795233","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/CFG-defaults-shared","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":101.6,"family":"alibaba","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"39d815e1b1511026","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/CFG-defaults-shared.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261113T034233Z-afb027d4.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794541455.6954114,"family":"google","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"gemini-3.5